      "detailed_description": "This is the cozy adventure of Nayu the fox!<br>What can you expect to encounter on this adventure?<br><br>The adventure is as simple as a click.<br>It is a laid back journey without any challenging action or puzzle elements. So, if you're tired of our gritty world, this is for you! <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476340/extras/f2cbbcf17684f60acd9c1f89557d52cb.poster.avif?t=1675675671\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476340/extras/f2cbbcf17684f60acd9c1f89557d52cb.webm?t=1675675671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476340/extras/f2cbbcf17684f60acd9c1f89557d52cb.mp4?t=1675675671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Adventuring 101 ◆</h2><strong>hit! (click)</strong><br><strong>hit!! (click)</strong><br><strong>hit!!! (click)</strong><br><i>*The weapons we use are made of soft materials. No enemies were harmed during the making of this adventure!</i><br><br>You can use the star shards you obtain along the way to train your party and unlock cute costumes! <br>The game works as an idle game.  Nayu will continue to battle even when you are busy!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476340/extras/472769a72fa04c60eda03cbc921b93e8.webp?t=1675675671\" width=144 height=22 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ STORY ◆</h2>Join Nayu the fox on her adventure! Meet friends, face foes and discover what the world of Nayu has to offer. <br>This adventure is short, sweet and especially cute!<br><i>Playing time: 20-30 minutes</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ ENDLESS ◆</h2>Keep on battling your way through the world of Nayu, forever!<br>This is the perfect mode to get your hands on star shards or to increase your level.<br><strong>You will be able to play Endless Mode after completing Story Mode.</strong><br><i>Playing time: As long as you like!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ BONUS ◆</h2><i>- Path to the Cheese -</i><br>A mini-game where you collect the Cheese.<br><strong>You will be able to play Path to the Cheese after completing Story Mode.</strong>",
